- Database migration strategy.
- Operational runbooks.

Never expose secrets in source control.

Provide an `.env.example` containing variable names and descriptions only, never real credentials.

Do not claim backups work until restore has been tested.

Do not claim deployment is complete unless the actual deployment has succeeded and been verified.

Do not claim production readiness while critical security, data integrity, or operational checks are failing.

