# 29. FINAL REPORTING REQUIREMENTS

At the end of each implementation phase, report:

- What was implemented.
- Which files were created or modified.
- Which database migrations were added.
- Which tests were executed.
- Which tests passed.
- Which tests failed.
- Which integrations were actually verified.
- Which features are still unavailable.
